2025-12-29 12:45:03,305 [INFO] root - Reduce阶段：筛选出 4 个高质量关键点，内容如下：[{'answer': '“相图计算”（CALPHAD）是一种核心的计算热力学方法，作为中央计算框架用于设计、评估和验证多种先进高温合金，包括γ′强化钴基超合金、CoNi基高熵超合金、INCONEL 617、Ni46.8Fe23Co10V7(Al, Si)6.6以及Ni-Re-M2和Ni-Co-M1三元体系。它通过热力学建模指导合金成分优化，并与实验数据交叉验证，加速高温合金开发流程。[cite: chunk-c93eee6a8c4411c3dd62bc80c1ada11f-e-5, chunk-7ebedf071364c78bc1bcfff608fe39c5-e-1, chunk-834d5858c36842a950b889631bc52d05-r-8, chunk-834d5858c36842a950b889631bc52d05-e-5, chunk-834d5858c36842a950b889631bc52d05-r-4, chunk-db86438736fda0de49cad63b063a4a09-e-1, chunk-db86438736fda0de49cad63b063a4a09-r-2, chunk-7180ec3f1341dd8299ea5fce6497149f-e-1, chunk-7180ec3f1341dd8299ea5fce6497149f-r-1, chunk-5fd0ec108355de250e38b813cb41d3de-e-1, chunk-5fd0ec108355de250e38b813cb41d3de-r-4, chunk-75a0a8d6d802cb719c1912e964a44820-e-2, chunk-75a0a8d6d802cb719c1912e964a44820-e-1, chunk-75a0a8d6d802cb719c1912e964a44820-r-2, chunk-75a0a8d6d802cb719c1912e964a44820-r-1]', 'score': 10}, {'answer': 'CALPHAD在高温合金开发中不仅用于成分设计，还与相场模拟工具MICRESS、固溶热处理工艺、放电等离子烧结（FAST）技术以及机器学习方法（如高斯过程回归）集成，形成多尺度、多物理场的协同开发体系，提升材料性能预测精度和工艺适配性。[cite: chunk-c93eee6a8c4411c3dd62bc80c1ada11f-e-5, chunk-b1ebd80a60c34a794e74e88f617e4b50-e-8, chunk-b1ebd80a60c34a794e74e88f617e4b50-r-9, chunk-0d78db952a4a0890ff05ba383a6bd7cc-e-2, chunk-0d78db952a4a0890ff05ba383a6bd7cc-r-2, chunk-b5ad2efcb00d66b99bf5398e7191597d-e-1, chunk-db86438736fda0de49cad63b063a4a09-r-3, chunk-1945f36de4a20707566b446327bd5052-e-1, chunk-606fcf7dad84695b81f58da28cfdc2c3-e-1, chunk-606fcf7dad84695b81f58da28cfdc2c3-r-1]', 'score': 9}, {'answer': 'CALPHAD方法被用于验证和优化适用于涡轮盘的γ′强化钴基高温合金，该类合金在高温高应力环境下表现出优异性能，同时其开发反过来也推动了CALPHAD热力学数据库和模型的改进，形成材料创新与计算方法迭代升级的正向反馈。[cite: chunk-6542d72e1fe020ba20ec3d195bda41be-e-7, chunk-7ebedf071364c78bc1bcfff608fe39c5-e-1, chunk-834d5858c36842a950b889631bc52d05-r-3, chunk-7ebedf071364c78bc1bcfff608fe39c5-e-1, chunk-c93eee6a8c4411c3dd62bc80c1ada11f-e-5, chunk-834d5858c36842a950b889631bc52d05-r-8]', 'score': 9}, {'answer': 'CALPHAD预测结果被用于与高熵合金AlMo0.5NbTa0.5TiZr的实验微结构进行对比，该合金具有有序B2基体且对冷却速率敏感，因此被用作验证CALPHAD模型准确性的基准材料，有助于完善热力学描述。[cite: chunk-79fc5de10ba2102ea3bf8a7d97173c9d-e-1, chunk-c93eee6a8c4411c3dd62bc80c1ada11f-e-5, chunk-4995bac74660b08a9a9ff12693c30ea8-r-2, chunk-79fc5de10ba2102ea3bf8a7d97173c9d-e-6, chunk-9af7a9f5ee0c2374c8191244b6ff52e5-r-1, chunk-913f45902e7ce48027047de1bd832dfe-e-3, chunk-13357e02ef972bd74c69f89174649d0e-r-1, chunk-9af7a9f5ee0c2374c8191244b6ff52e5-e-5, chunk-9af7a9f5ee0c2374c8191244b6ff52e5-e-4, chunk-9af7a9f5ee0c2374c8191244b6ff52e5-r-9, chunk-9af7a9f5ee0c2374c8191244b6ff52e5-r-10]', 'score': 8}]
